          "settings": {
            "heading": "Delivery Information",
            "icon": "none",
            "text": "<h6><strong> Game-changing convenience</strong></h6><p>We offer 2 hours delivery within the same day across Dubai, all days of the week, 10am-10pm. For Sharjah and Ajman, same say  4pm-10pm  delivery for orders confirmed before 1pm all days of the week.</p><p>Sustainable and responsible packaging is an integral part of our company strategy; we use suppliers including MULTIVAC, one of the leading providers worldwide of packaging solutions for food.</p><h6><strong>Is there a delivery minimum?</strong></h6><p>No minimum order value and our standard delivery fee is 10 AED</p><h6><strong>When do you deliver?</strong></h6><p>We offer express delivery within 3 hours across Dubai & Abu Dhabi.For Sharjah and Ajman, we offer same day 4pm-10pm delivery for orders confirmed before 1pm all days of the week.<br/><br/></p><h6><strong>Do I need to tip my delivery driver?</strong></h6><p>There’s no need to tip your delivery driver — we are committed to paying a living wage that doesn’t depend on tips.</p><h6>Where do you deliver?</h6><p>MLS is currently delivering in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah & Ajman only. </p>",
            "page": "",
